### ==========================================
### 1. MONITOREO Y SALUD
### ==========================================

### Ping de Salud
GET http://localhost:8000/api/ping

---

### ==========================================
### 2. GESTIÓN DE USUARIOS (DATOS DE EIDER)
### ==========================================

### Crear Usuario
# Usamos los datos de eider que ya funcionan
POST http://localhost:8000/api/user-group-manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "janus_test@casanare.com",
    "username": "eider",
    "password": "samuel89*",
    "group_id": "50",
    "group_role": "operators-user",
    "id_contrato": "CONT-YOP-100"
}

### Actualizar Contraseña (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/user-group-manager/OKTV-6368
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "group_id": "50",
    "new_password": "YopalNuevaClave2026*"
}

### Actualizar Rol (PATCH) - ¡Verifica el cambio en el listado después!
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/user-group-manager/OKTV-6368
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "group_id": "50",
    "new_role": "operators-operator_admin"
}

### Publicar / Despublicar (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/user-group-manager/OKTV-6368
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "group_id": "50",
    "publish": true
}

### Eliminar de Operador / Suspensión Individual (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/user-group-manager/OKTV-6368/group/50

---

### ==========================================
### 3. DASHBOARD Y PROCESOS CASANARE
### ==========================================

### Listado General para el Dashboard (Angular)
# Úsalo después de cada PATCH para verificar que la DB local cambió
GET http://localhost:8000/api/microok/cuentas

### Consultar Contrato Específico
GET http://localhost:8000/api/microok/cortes/CONT-YOP-100

### Procesar Cortes Mensuales (Masivo)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/cron/cortes/mensuales
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "contratos": ["CONT-YOP-100", "TEMP-1775488621", "ABC1234"]
}